ASET-CAUSAL-NET 1 ASET-SEED-0.4-ALPHA-CAUSAL
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE

PLACE U UNKNOWN INITIAL 1
PLACE A ALLOW INITIAL 0
PLACE B BLOCK INITIAL 0

INVARIANT RECOGNITION-ONEHOT U A B TOTAL 1

TRANSITION OBSERVE-UNKNOWN ASET-COMPONENT-OBSERVE-UNKNOWN
FROM U
REQUIRE EVIDENCE_ARGUMENT
EFFECT ADD_EVIDENCE
TO U
END

TRANSITION RECOGNIZE-ALLOW ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-ALLOW
FROM U
REQUIRE EVIDENCE_ARGUMENT
REQUIRE OBSERVED_EVIDENCE
REQUIRE LOCAL_AUTHORITY_ALLOW
TO A
END

TRANSITION RECOGNIZE-BLOCK ASET-COMPONENT-RECOGNIZE-BLOCK
FROM U
REQUIRE EVIDENCE_ARGUMENT
REQUIRE OBSERVED_EVIDENCE
REQUIRE LOCAL_AUTHORITY_BLOCK
TO B
END

TRANSITION PRESERVE-UNKNOWN ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-UNKNOWN
FROM U
EFFECT PRESERVE_STATE
TO U
END

TRANSITION PRESERVE-ALLOW ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-ALLOW
FROM A
EFFECT PRESERVE_STATE
TO A
END

TRANSITION PRESERVE-BLOCK ASET-COMPONENT-PRESERVE-BLOCK
FROM B
EFFECT PRESERVE_STATE
TO B
END
